## Saving Scan Results

Documentation is important in cybersecurity. Nmap allows saving results.

### Save in normal format

`nmap -oN normal_output.txt localhost`

Human-readable format.

### Save in XML format

`nmap -oX xml_output.xml localhost`

Useful for automation and tools.

### Save in grepable format

`nmap -oG grepable_output.txt localhost`

Useful for filtering specific information.

